  "slug": "viewnode-all-widgets-viewnode-all-widgets-compositional-refactor",
  "title": "viewnode-all-widgets: ViewNode → all widgets (compositional refactor)",
  "discussedAt": "",
  "contextReady": false,
  "contextReadyReason": "",
  "summary": "TOP PRIORITY standing: every widget's content composed from child Components (the tree realize produces) and ViewNode-realizable; refactor touched widgets toward this.",
  "description": "Now a prime project rule (AGENTS.md ⭐ WIDGET ARCHITECTURE): every widget's *content* must be composed from child `Component`s (the tree `realize` produces) and be `ViewNode`-realizable; refactor the widget you touch toward this. Two parts:\n\n**viewnode-task-1 — complete `realize` coverage** (`heca/src/chrome/realize.rs`): missing `Select`/`Tabs`/`Grid`/`ItemGroup`/`DockFrame`/`MarkerGroup`/`ScrollBar`/`Toast` (structured props, was `plugin-task-ui-9`). Each missing WidgetKind needs a `realize` arm that builds the heca-grid-ui widget from `ViewNode` props resolved against `Theme`, wires events to `Intent`s, recurses children, attaches via `.child(...)`.\n\n**viewnode-task-2 — compose the leaf widgets** so content = child components, not hand-drawn in `paint`. `Button` is the first target: it hand-draws its label text directly → make it a container with a content slot (`leading`/`label`/`trailing`, like `Item` already does). This unblocks the button-accelerator feature (`button-shortcut` phase). Do in a FRESH session (large refactor).\n\nReference: `docs/widget-architecture.md` (SETTLED — §5 lists already-decided questions; do not re-derive). `heca-grid-ui` NEVER depends on `heca`; `ViewNode` lives in the app (`heca/src/chrome/view.rs`); `realize` is the ONE bridge. Widgets hold children (`impl Component`); realized subtrees enter via `*_boxed` setters (`Dialog::body_boxed` precedent).\n\nBehaviors to preserve: existing widget variants/styling read from `Theme` (no hardcoded colors/sizes); callbacks/signals still work via the reactive facade; showcase (`cargo run -p heca-renderer --example showcase`) stays green; `docs/widgets.md` + rustdoc updated in the same change.\n\nStatus source: BACKLOG.md ⭐ SESSION STATUS 2026-07-13 (TOP PRIORITY, standing).",
